# Everything here runs on Linux. Authored on Windows, so force LF in the repo
# AND in the working tree — a .sh or systemd unit checked out with CRLF fails on
# the Pi with "bad interpreter: No such file or directory".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.env  text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer   text eol=lf
